***** FRONTLINE_FORCES n places armour and seeds FARP helicopter groups [ai/parser/parsgen.c:243 parser_campaign_file]
***** KEYSITE, CREATE_MEMBERS, CREATE_GROUP, CREATE_TASK scripted forces and missions [ai/parser/parsgen.c:243 parser_campaign_file]
**** Triggers
***** Message triggers: TASK_COMPLETED/FAILED, OBJECT_DESTROYED/FIRED/TARGETED/LANDED, SECTOR_WON/LOST/REACHED, WAYPOINT_REACHED [entity/system/en_types/en_force.c:139 campaign_trigger_names]
***** Polled triggers: TIME_DURATION, VARIABLE_CONDITION, RANDOM (rand16 % value == 0) [ai/parser/parsgen.c:2588 trigger_triggered]
