** L1 Theatre picture (map, sectors, influence)
*** Sector grid
**** Sector entities (local only, created before networked entities) [entity/special/sector/sc_seccreat.c:87 create_local_sector_entities]
***** Sector side = BLUE if blue influence > red else RED (ties go red) [entity/special/sector/sc_int.c:200 get_local_int_value]
***** Tallest structure height tracked as entities link in [entity/special/sector/sc_msgs.c:79 response_to_link_child]
***** Sector counts per force refreshed every minute [entity/special/sector/sector.c:579 update_sector_side_count]
**** Map bounds
***** 5 km map perimeter excluded from placements [entity/system/en_main/en_world.h:135 MAP_PERIMETER_SIZE]
***** Altitude range -8000 to 65535 m [entity/system/en_main/en_world.c:86 set_entity_world_map_size]
**** Initial sides
***** Side PSD: red > 240 RED, blue > 240 BLUE, anything else fatal [ai/faction/popread.c:341 read_sector_side_file]
***** Binary .DAT alternative [ai/ai_misc/ai_dbase.c:119 load_ai_sector_data]
*** Influence maps (imaps)
**** Storage
***** imaps[type][side] one byte per sector, normalised 0..255 [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:156 get_imap_value]
***** Renormalised every 2 min, staggered 20 s offsets [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:181 start_high_level_ai]
**** Sector side influence
***** Keysite pushes sector_side_max_value with falloff 1/((0.3dx+1)^2+(0.3dz+1)^2) [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:335 update_imap_sector_side]
***** Removed and re-added on capture or destruction [entity/special/keysite/ks_pack.c:284 unpack_local_keysite_data]
**** Importance
***** Keysite importance spread over importance_radius with (1 - r^2/R^2) [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:454 update_imap_importance_level]
**** Distance to friendly base
***** Max of (1 - r^2/R^2) over air_coverage_radius of in-use keysites [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:618 update_keysite_distance_to_friendly_base]
***** Recomputed for the whole side after capture or loss [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:694 update_imap_distance_to_friendly_base]
**** Threat layers
***** Air defence: potential surface-to-air threat over 10 x air scan range [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:844 update_imap_surface_to_air_defence_level]
***** Surface defence: potential surface-to-surface threat over 10 x surface scan range [ai/highlevl/imaps.c:1009 update_imap_surface_to_surface_defence_level]
***** Vehicles add or remove values as they enter or leave a sector [entity/special/sector/sector.c:238 add_mobile_values_to_sector]
*** Fog of war
**** Gain
***** Unit's own sector set to max; sectors within 2 x recon radius get (1 - r/R) x max [entity/special/sector/sector.c:374 set_sector_fog_of_war_value]
***** Owned sectors always read as fully known [entity/special/sector/sector.c:510 get_sector_fog_of_war_value]
**** Decay
***** Every sector loses FOG_OF_WAR_DECAY_RATE (30 s) per tick [entity/special/sector/sector.c:533 update_sector_fog_of_war]
**** Use as gate
***** Task generators require fog above 0.2-0.5 x max before targeting [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:575 create_bai_tasks]
***** Objective names shown only if known or fog > 0.1 [entity/special/task/task.c:1475 get_task_objective_string]
***** Groups keep last seen time and last known position [entity/special/group/gp_vec3d.c:79 get_local_vec3d]
*** Frontline
**** Own sectors adjacent (8-way) to enemy sectors become frontline [ai/frontl/ai_fline.c:125 create_frontline]
***** Chain ordered from the sector with fewest 4-way neighbours [ai/frontl/ai_fline.c:250 parse_frontline_arrangements]
***** Rebuilt for all forces on change [ai/frontl/ai_fline.c:383 recreate_frontline]
*** Road network and routes
**** Road graph
***** Nodes with safe radius, side occupying, aware, exploring [ai/ai_misc/ai_route.c:898 get_road_sub_route]
***** Link breaks count destroyed bridges, max 32 per link [ai/ai_misc/ai_route.c:1069 set_road_link_breaks]
**** Biased route generation
***** Recursive midpoint subdivision while segment > 5 km [ai/taskgen/croute.c:1132 generate_biased_vec3d_route]
****** Candidate score = elevation bias x terrain + range bias + enemy-sector bias; lowest wins [ai/taskgen/croute.c:1132 generate_biased_vec3d_route]
****** Per movement type: AIR elev 5 range 0.5; GROUND 1/1; SEA elev 9999 [ai/taskgen/croute.c:114 route_biasing_database]
****** Near-collinear nodes (cos > 0.94) removed [ai/taskgen/croute.c:1559 optimise_route]
*** Terrain
**** Terrain classes: water, land, forest; ground-vehicle suitability per type [misc/terr_db.c:153 initialise_terrain_database]
***** Fields and forest floor not drivable; roads, beach, built-up are [misc/terr_db.c:153 initialise_terrain_database]
** L2 Force (side) strategic AI
*** Force entity
**** Attitude COWARD..ERRATIC (default NORMAL) [entity/special/force/fc_creat.c:79 create_local]
***** Task generation enable flag per task type [entity/special/force/fc_creat.c:79 create_local]
***** Hardware reserves per category (armed/unarmed FW, heli, routed, ship) [entity/system/en_types/en_force.c:169 force_info_catagory_names]
**** Force info book-keeping
***** Spawned units use up a reserve once the game is running [entity/special/force/force.c:211 add_to_force_info]
***** Losses tracked per category [entity/special/force/force.c:249 remove_from_force_info]
***** Regen arrivals add back to reserve [entity/special/force/force.c:278 replace_into_force_info]
*** High-level task scheduler
**** Campaign cadence
***** CAS 15 min, patrols 5 min, advance/retreat 12 min, keysite strike 7.5 min, artillery 15 min [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:181 start_high_level_ai]
***** Troop insertion 2 min, OCA sweep 30, heli transfer 7.5, FW transfer 15, SEAD 12, BAI 20, OCA strike 30 min [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:181 start_high_level_ai]
**** Skirmish cadence (faster)
***** CAS 6 min, SEAD 10, advance/retreat 15, artillery 12, keysite strike 10, BAI 10 min [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:181 start_high_level_ai]
**** Common generator pattern
***** Scan up to 160 enemy targets, rate from imaps, sort, take top N [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:84 MAX_HIGHLEVEL_TARGET_CHECKS]
***** Only targets with rating >= 0.75 x best [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:86 MIN_TASK_CREATION_RATIO]
***** Skip targets already the object of a task; per-sector caps [entity/special/task/task.c:618 entity_is_object_of_task]
***** Priority = rating / max x task_database priority [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:815 create_cas_tasks]
*** Task generators
**** Close air support
***** Enemy frontline groups; rating (1 - air def) + 3 base dist + 2 side ratio, max 6; 1 per sector [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:815 create_cas_tasks]
**** Battlefield air interdiction
***** Enemy rear groups; rating 2(1 - air def) + 3 base dist + 2 side ratio; fog > 0.5 max [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:575 create_bai_tasks]
****** Creates BAI plus RECON [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:575 create_bai_tasks]
**** Keysite strike
***** Rating (1 - air def) + 4 base dist + 2(1 - efficiency) + 2 side ratio, max 9 [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1026 create_keysite_strike_tasks]
****** Recon target or fog &lt; 0.25 max: RECON first, strike follows as reaction [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1026 create_keysite_strike_tasks]
****** Else efficiency >= minimum: GROUND_STRIKE or ANTI_SHIP_STRIKE [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1026 create_keysite_strike_tasks]
**** Offensive counter-air
***** OCA targets; rating (1 - air def) + 4 base dist + 2 side ratio; fog >= 0.25 max [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1286 create_oca_strike_tasks]
****** OCA_STRIKE 1 per cycle, OCA_SWEEP 2 per cycle [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1473 create_oca_sweep_tasks]
**** SEAD
***** Enemy rear groups with air attack strength 10; rating 4 base dist + 3 side ratio [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1918 create_sead_tasks]
***** Around struck keysite: up to 3 SEAD on AA groups within 4 km [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:2576 create_sead_tasks_around_keysite]
**** Troop insertion
***** Weakened keysites (efficiency &lt; minimum); rating adds 3(1 - eff) [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1660 create_troop_insertion_tasks]
****** Recon first if recon target or fog &lt; 0.2 max [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1660 create_troop_insertion_tasks]
****** Defender launches backup troop insertion if fewer than 2 patrols [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:1660 create_troop_insertion_tasks]
**** Transfers (rebasing)
***** Rating 4 x enemy base distance + 4(1 - idle groups / 4), max 8 [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:2132 create_fixed_wing_transfer_tasks]
****** Neediest keysites receive from least needy, up to 3 pairs [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:2352 create_helicopter_transfer_tasks]
**** Ground war
***** Advance: frontline groups move to an adjacent unoccupied, unbroken road node with better enemy-base gradient [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:375 create_advance_and_retreat_tasks]
***** Artillery: frontline artillery engages enemy groups or keysites in weapon range, up to 5 [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:2838 create_artillery_strike_tasks]
***** Troop patrols: one 4-man patrol per FARP, military base, airbase [ai/highlevl/highlevl.c:2735 create_troop_patrol_tasks]
*** Reactions
**** On task assigned against our keysite
***** requires_cap: defender CAP 30 min [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:217 create_reaction_to_offensive_keysite_task_assigned]
***** requires_barcap: BARCAP 6 km out toward the attacker [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:217 create_reaction_to_offensive_keysite_task_assigned]
**** On successful recon
***** More than 1 SEAD needed: SEAD instead of strike [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:314 create_reaction_to_recon_task_completed]
***** Otherwise TI if weakened, OCA strike+sweep, ground strike, anti-ship, SEAD or BAI by target [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:314 create_reaction_to_recon_task_completed]
**** On strike completed
***** Restrike while efficiency >= minimum; BDA if recon target [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:609 create_reaction_to_strike_task_completed]
**** On artillery fire
***** Victim side launches BAI plus RECON on the battery [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:703 create_reaction_to_artillery_fire]
**** Campaign Commander map click
***** Player orders TI, strike, OCA, anti-ship, SEAD, BAI or CAS on clicked target [ai/highlevl/reaction.c:818 create_reaction_to_map_click]
***** camcom 2 allows duplicate tasks [cmndline.c:274 session_camcom]
*** Logistics
**** Low-supply requests
***** Keysite stock &lt;= 75 and it consumes that supply [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:337 update_keysite_cargo]
***** Ground group ammo or fuel &lt; 100 [entity/special/group/group.c:619 assess_group_supplies]
**** Supply task creation
***** Ammo from factory (else refinery) or airbase within 10 km, whichever is nearer [entity/special/force/fc_msgs.c:672 response_to_force_low_on_supplies]
***** Fuel from refinery (else factory) or airbase; one task per cargo type [entity/special/force/fc_msgs.c:672 response_to_force_low_on_supplies]
**** Supply flight
***** PICK_UP takes cargo; supplier stock -= 10 [entity/special/keysite/ks_msgs.c:251 response_to_waypoint_pick_up_reached]
***** Crates dropped every 100 m between DROP_OFF and FINISH_DROP_OFF [entity/mobile/aircraft/fixwing/fixwing.c:80 update_fixed_wing_crate_dropping]
***** DROP_OFF restocks the requesting keysite [entity/mobile/mb_msgs.c:906 response_to_waypoint_drop_off_reached]
**** Turnaround time
***** Rearm sleep = base x (5 - 4 x ammo supply / 100), 1x to 5x [entity/system/en_types/en_suply.c:95 get_local_entity_rearming_sleep_time]
***** Refuel sleep scales the same way with fuel supply [entity/system/en_types/en_suply.c:126 get_local_entity_refueling_sleep_time]
*** Assistance requests
**** Fired-at group or keysite asks its force, 60 s +/- 20 s cooldown [entity/special/group/gp_msgs.c:295 response_to_entity_fired_at]
***** Force sends idle-engage air groups within speed x 2 km to attack the aggressor [entity/special/force/fc_msgs.c:1022 response_to_request_assistance]
*** Order of battle
**** Divisions built per force [ai/highlevl/order.c:690 initialise_order_of_battle]
***** Armoured: companies of 3 frontline groups; artillery companies [ai/highlevl/order.c:690 initialise_order_of_battle]
***** Airborne: attack, transport, fighter companies per airbase and carrier [ai/highlevl/order.c:690 initialise_order_of_battle]
***** Carrier task force and infantry brigades per base [ai/highlevl/order.c:690 initialise_order_of_battle]
**** Division database
***** Company caps: armoured brigade 4 groups, artillery brigade 2, 0 = unlimited [entity/special/division/dv_dbase.c:80 division_database]
***** add_group_to_division reuses a company with a vacancy or creates one [entity/special/division/division.c:149 add_group_to_division]
*** Reinforcement (regeneration)
**** Queues
***** Circular queue per side and regen type (FW, heli, ground, people, sea), default 5 [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:763 regen_queue_insert]
***** Dead aircraft and vehicles queued by type and group [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:656 add_entity_to_regen_queue]
***** 10 infantry patrols preloaded per side; people never drained [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:892 initialise_regen_queues]
**** Spawn conditions
***** Regen building alive, keysite usable, category reserve > 0 [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:199 regen_update]
***** No human player landed at that keysite [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:199 regen_update]
***** Apache Havoc campaigns skip people and FW transports [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:199 regen_update]
**** Spawn
***** One member created at the regen point, building doors open 30 s [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:199 regen_update]
***** Period = regen_frequency[side] x difficulty modifier (always 1.0) [entity/special/regen/regen.c:328 get_regen_frequency_difficulty_modifier]
***** Queue size grows or shrinks on capture or loss of bases [entity/special/regen/rg_updt.c:955 increment_regen_queue_size]
** L3 Keysites (bases and objectives)
*** Keysite database
**** AIRBASE: ammo -0.2 fuel -0.4, importance 1.0, 80 km radius, 400 km air cover, LARGE, assign 3 reserve 2, CAP [entity/special/keysite/ks_dbase.c:82 keysite_database]
***** OCA, recon, strike and troop target, repairable, campaign objective [entity/special/keysite/ks_dbase.c:82 keysite_database]
