***** MILITARY_BASE importance 0.8 objective; POWER_STATION fuel -0.5 objective; RADIO_TRANSMITTER 0.5 [entity/special/keysite/ks_dbase.c:82 keysite_database]
***** Minimum efficiency 0.3 for every type [entity/special/keysite/ks_dbase.c:82 keysite_database]
*** Placement and construction
**** Population placement file
***** City KEY_* templates become power, radio, factory, port, military, oil keysites [ai/faction/popread.c:918 read_population_city_placements]
***** Airports become AIRBASE, FARP objects FARP, water airfields ANCHORAGE carriers [ai/faction/popread.c:1476 read_population_airfield_placements]
***** SAM placements become anti-aircraft groups [ai/faction/popread.c:2148 read_population_sam_placements]
