***** FW routes: APPROACH, LOWER_UNDERCARRIAGE, TOUCH_DOWN, TAXI, LANDED; takeoff START_UP..TAKEN_OFF [ai/faction/popread.c:2814 insert_airport_fixedwing_routes]
***** Heli routes and holding loops expanded x3 from centroid [ai/faction/popread.c:3096 insert_airport_helicopter_routes]
**** Buildings
