**** Strength = sum of building importance; efficiency = strength / max [entity/special/keysite/ks_float.c:223 get_local_float_value]
***** Building destroyed subtracts importance, tasks re-assessed [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:739 subtract_local_entity_importance_from_keysite]
***** Efficiency &lt;= minimum: non-repairable destroyed, repairable goes UNUSABLE [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:739 subtract_local_entity_importance_from_keysite]
*** Server update loop
**** Every 3 min: assign RECON, STRIKE, SUPPORT tasks (x2 interval if unusable) [entity/special/keysite/ks_updt.c:82 update_server]
***** assign_keysite_tasks picks highest-priority unassigned tasks, up to assign count [ai/taskgen/assign.c:96 assign_keysite_tasks]
****** reserve count of non-critical tasks held back for the player while time remains [ai/taskgen/assign.c:96 assign_keysite_tasks]
**** Every minute: supplies += database usage, cargo crates spawned, bounded 10..100 [entity/special/keysite/ks_updt.c:82 update_server]
