***** While REPAIRING: one dead building restored per 10 min, regen buildings 20 min [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:1581 repair_client_server_entity_keysite]
*** Under attack
**** Structure hit: assist timer, aircraft aggressor triggers CAP (priority 10, 15 min) [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:854 notify_keysite_structure_under_attack]
