***** Side and force switched, imaps moved, buildings change side [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:1289 capture_keysite]
***** cpac option: idle landed aircraft groups defect to the captor [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:1289 capture_keysite]
***** Up to 5 structures repaired; regen queues +6 heli +4 FW for airbases, +2 heli for FARPs [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:1289 capture_keysite]
***** Loser's regen shrinks: airbase heli -6 FW -4, FARP -2 [entity/special/keysite/keysite.c:945 destroy_keysite]
** L4 Missions (tasks)
*** Task database
**** Fields: category, priority, difficulty, ROE, engage, escort threshold, primary/solo/persistent, pass %, score, AI stat needs [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:100 task_database]
**** Strike category
***** BAI p4 d3 ROE objective, 25/75 %, 1000 pts, ground attack 6 [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:284]
***** CAS p6 d3 min 2 aircraft, 25/75 %, ground attack 8 [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:466]
***** GROUND_STRIKE p9 d4 min 2, escort at difficulty 3, 10/25 % [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:834]
***** ANTI_SHIP_STRIKE p7 d4 escort 3, 25/50 %, 750 pts [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:223]
***** SEAD p9 d4 escort 5, 10/100 % [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:1325]
***** OCA_STRIKE p6 10/33 %; OCA_SWEEP p7 25/50 % air attack 5 [entity/special/task/ts_dbase.c:1025]
